  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Humanitarian and Health Response for the internally displaced and most vulnerable population in Ukraine</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="IT">Risposta integrata Umanitaria e Sanitaria a favore della popolazione sfollata interna e pi&#xf9; vulnerabile in Ucraina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the hospitals of the 7 target oblasts through the provision of medicines and health equipment and support the internally displaced and host communities  in Chernivtsi and Ivano-Frankivsk with the distribution of food and hygiene kits and the promotion of mental health. Among key activities, adequate health services to address SGBV are essential to ensure life-saving care for women, girls and other at-risk groups</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="IT">Supportare gli ospedali dei 7 oblast target attraverso la fornitura di farmaci e equipment sanitari e sostenere gli sfollati interni a Chernivtsi e Ivano-Frankivsk e le comunit&#xe0; ospitanti  con la distribuzione di kit alimentari e igienici e la promozione della salute mentale.</narrative>
  </description>
